From 5f5acaee29435a73bc072db901dec969cd267948 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:00:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] docs: add the required audio libraries to the Ubuntu and
 Fedora dependency lists
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The build hard-requires Ogg, Vorbis, Opus, and OpusFile
(mm/CMakeLists.txt find_package ... REQUIRED), and the Nix section
already lists them, but the Ubuntu and Fedora install lines in
BUILDING.md do not — a fresh box following the docs fails at configure
with "Could NOT find Ogg". Add the four dev packages to both package
manager lines (gcc and clang variants).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 docs/BUILDING.md | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/BUILDING.md b/docs/BUILDING.md
index 98a4a34a9..e4d6248fe 100644
--- a/docs/BUILDING.md
+++ b/docs/BUILDING.md
@@ -89,10 +89,10 @@ C:\Program Files\CMake\bin\cmake.exe --build build-cmake --target ExtractAssetHe
 #### Debian/Ubuntu
 ```sh
 # using gcc
-apt-get install gcc g++ git cmake ninja-build lsb-release libsdl2-dev libpng-dev libsdl2-net-dev libzip-dev zipcmp zipmerge ziptool nlohmann-json3-dev libtinyxml2-dev libspdlog-dev libopengl-dev
+apt-get install gcc g++ git cmake ninja-build lsb-release libsdl2-dev libpng-dev libsdl2-net-dev libzip-dev zipcmp zipmerge ziptool nlohmann-json3-dev libtinyxml2-dev libspdlog-dev libopengl-dev libogg-dev libvorbis-dev libopus-dev libopusfile-dev
 
 # or using clang
-apt-get install clang git cmake ninja-build lsb-release libsdl2-dev libpng-dev libsdl2-net-dev libzip-dev zipcmp zipmerge ziptool nlohmann-json3-dev libtinyxml2-dev libspdlog-dev libopengl-dev
+apt-get install clang git cmake ninja-build lsb-release libsdl2-dev libpng-dev libsdl2-net-dev libzip-dev zipcmp zipmerge ziptool nlohmann-json3-dev libtinyxml2-dev libspdlog-dev libopengl-dev libogg-dev libvorbis-dev libopus-dev libopusfile-dev
 ```
 #### Arch
 ```sh
@@ -105,10 +105,10 @@ pacman -S clang git cmake ninja lsb-release sdl2 libpng libzip nlohmann-json tin
 #### Fedora
 ```sh
 # using gcc
-dnf install gcc gcc-c++ git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel
+dnf install gcc gcc-c++ git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel libogg-devel libvorbis-devel opus-devel opusfile-devel
 
 # or using clang
-dnf install clang git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel
+dnf install clang git cmake ninja-build lsb_release SDL2-devel libpng-devel libzip-devel libzip-tools nlohmann-json-devel tinyxml2-devel spdlog-devel libogg-devel libvorbis-devel opus-devel opusfile-devel
 ```
